@startuml uc_004_findings
!include common/uc_styles.puml

title **UC-004 — Finding Lifecycle**\n(Bounded Context: Finding Lifecycle · C4: findings_application)

left to right direction

actor "Regulatory\nOfficial" as RO #E3F2FD
actor "Compliance\nRepresentative" as CR #E8EAF6

rectangle "Selma Application" as SYS {
  rectangle "Finding Lifecycle\n(findings_application)" as BOUNDED {

    usecase "Create Finding\n(auto from inspection)" as UC1
    usecase "Open Finding"              as UC2
    usecase "Submit Evidence"           as UC3
    usecase "Validate Finding"          as UC4
    usecase "Remediate Finding"         as UC5
    usecase "Verify Finding"            as UC6
    usecase "Waive Finding"             as UC7
    usecase "Dismiss Finding"           as UC8
    usecase "Close Finding"             as UC9
    usecase "View Finding Details"      as UC10
    usecase "Supersede Finding"         as UC11
  }
}

' ---- Regulatory Official associations ----
RO --> UC4
RO --> UC6
RO --> UC7
RO --> UC8
RO --> UC10
RO --> UC11

' ---- Compliance Representative associations ----
CR --> UC3
CR --> UC5
CR --> UC10

' ---- includes / extends ----
UC1 ..> UC2 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC9 : <<include>>
UC7 ..> UC9 : <<include>>
UC8 ..> UC9 : <<include>>
UC11 ..> UC9 : <<include>>

' ---- notes ----
note right of UC1
  **Pre:** Inspection completed with non-conformances
  **Post:** Finding created; event appended to finding_events
  **Contract:** finding_lifecycle/transitions.yaml (TR-FL-001)
  **C4:** inspections_application → findings_application → finding_events_repository
end note

note right of UC6
  **Pre:** Finding in Pending Verification state,
  Regulatory Official has approve_remediation capability
  **Post:** Finding state → verified → closed
  **Contract:** finding_lifecycle/transitions.yaml (TR-FL-007)
  **SoD:** SOD-002 — submitter cannot approve own remediation
end note

note right of UC7
  **Pre:** Finding in open/validated state,
  Regulatory Official has waive capability
  **Post:** Finding state → waived → closed
  **Contract:** finding_lifecycle/transitions.yaml (TR-FL-004)
  **SoD:** SOD-001 — creator cannot waive own findings
end note

note right of UC11
  **Pre:** Finding in Open state,
  Regulatory Official has supersede capability
  **Post:** Finding state → superseded (terminal)
  **Contract:** finding_lifecycle/transitions.yaml (TR-FL-012)
  **SoD:** SOD-003 — creator cannot supersede own findings
end note

note bottom of UC9
  **Pre:** Finding in terminal-ready state
  **Post:** Finding state → closed;
  audit entry in finding_events
  **Contract:** finding_lifecycle/transitions.yaml
  **Note:** Remediation ticketing / long-term audit export
  are optional ops integrations, not product peers
end note

@enduml
